    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the main characters are Vtubers!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a pixelated top-down comical fantasy magical action game brought to you by Magical Girl Kohaku.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while training, Magical Girl Kohaku rescues an elf being chased by a monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This leads to various encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a mysterious world with many companions while inheriting the &quot;will of the magical&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will be the beginning of a grand legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0About this game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This is a traditional top-down 2D action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience 8-bit style graphics and a fantasy world view throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A UI design with simple controls inspired by retro games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A wide variety of items appear, including weapons, shields, bombs, and bows and arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these items skillfully to solve simple puzzles and progress through your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, use a bomb to destroy a hidden wall, or use a bow and arrow to push a switch at a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In addition to Vtuber Magical Girl Kohaku, many other real-life Vtubers appear as playable player characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Allies you meet can switch with the main character as playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Xbox controller is fully compatible with in-game controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- BGM/SE volume adjustment, resolution change, and key configuration are all implemented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Protagonist (Magical Girl Kohaku)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634670/extras/9b0e36fa24068736be692dfb629e4b32.avif?t=1752674827\" width=139 height=170 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the main characters are Vtubers!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a pixelated top-down comical fantasy magical action game brought to you by Magical Girl Kohaku.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while training, Magical Girl Kohaku rescues an elf being chased by a monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This leads to various encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a mysterious world with many companions while inheriting the &quot;will of the magical&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will be the beginning of a grand legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0About this game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This is a traditional top-down 2D action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience 8-bit style graphics and a fantasy world view throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A UI design with simple controls inspired by retro games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A wide variety of items appear, including weapons, shields, bombs, and bows and arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these items skillfully to solve simple puzzles and progress through your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, use a bomb to destroy a hidden wall, or use a bow and arrow to push a switch at a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In addition to Vtuber Magical Girl Kohaku, many other real-life Vtubers appear as playable player characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Allies you meet can switch with the main character as playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Xbox controller is fully compatible with in-game controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- BGM/SE volume adjustment, resolution change, and key configuration are all implemented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Protagonist (Magical Girl Kohaku)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634670/extras/9b0e36fa24068736be692dfb629e4b32.avif?t=1752674827\" width=139 height=170 /></span></p>",
